    "a 2x5 pin header and a small shrouded connector below U4: function unread; candidates for JTAG or a UART console, unconfirmed",
    "three small BGAs beside U4 marked '2FA17 / RW186' (two) and 'RW251': two-line marks in Micron's FBGA format, read through Micron's FBGA decoder; a neighbouring code (RW187) is identified elsewhere as Micron serial NOR boot flash, so configuration or firmware flash is the leading reading, undecoded",
    "two thin white flat-cable connectors at one corner: low-speed sideband by shape, function unread",
    "PCB fab mark 'TTM 94V0 RFB1 2923' in the listing photograph: TTM Technologies, UL 94V-0; '2923' reads as a week-29-of-2023 date code, format unconfirmed",
